Array Traversal:
     1) Using for loop:
        public class Main {
            public static void main(String[] args) {

                int[] array = {1, 2, 3, 4, 5};

                for (int i = 0; i < array.length; i++) {
                    System.out.print(array[i] + " ");
                }
            }
        }
     2) Using for each loop:
        public class Main {
            public static void main(String[] args) {

                int[] array = {1, 2, 3, 4, 5};

                for (int x : array) {
                    System.out.println(x + " ");
                }
            }
        }      
